        "original_id": "da28a17b-aec8-5e92-9e24-b21b10b7a45f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 2 Days & 1 Night, Escape to Hangover\n- Organizations: KBS2, Drug Restaurant, JJY Band\n- People: Kim Jong-min, Cha Tae-hyun, Kim Joon-ho, Defconn, Yoon Shi-yoon, Jung Joon-young\n- Topics: South Korean reality-variety shows\n\nFacts:\n- 2 Days & 1 Night is a South Korean reality-variety show that began airing on KBS2 on August 5, 2007.\n- Since 2015, Jung Joon-young has been the lead vocalist of the rock band Drug Restaurant.\n- Drug Restaurant was previously known as JJY Band.\n- Drug Restaurant released its first album, Escape to Hangover, in May 2015.\n- The current cast of 2 Days & 1 Night includes Kim Jong-min, Cha Tae-hyun, Kim Joon-ho, Defconn, Yoon Shi-yoon, and Jung Joon-young.",
